lor:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;ash of $11 million and $21 million &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;, respectively, and restricted cash of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;$194 million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;, and includes long-term restricted cash of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;$24 million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;$50 million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt; as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;March 3